<title>UK: Pre-market trade slow on LME, prices hold steady.</title>
<headline>Pre-market trade slow on LME, prices hold steady.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Around overnight levels after modest 175-tonne stock fall.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Running just under $1,600. Helped by solid 2,550-tonne inventory drawdown.</p>
<p>OTHERS - Quiet, with steadier tendency.</p>
</text>
